{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想戒煙或擺脫電子煙、snus 等尼古丁產品的使用者，可利用 Quit Day 記錄無煙時數、省錢進度與身體恢復情況；此應用原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-64.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時追蹤戒煙進度</h2>\n<p>Quit Day 適用於香煙、手捲煙、電子煙與 snus 等尼古丁產品，讓使用者選擇後即時追蹤無煙時數，並同步查看省下金額與身體恢復進度。應用提供健康時間線、逐日攀升的等級，以及在渴望時刻提供支持；所有資料只保留在裝置上，私隱度高。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-302-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-303-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-304-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-305-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-306-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-307-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Quit Day</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/quit-day/id6809604028?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:48.143947+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:39:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:40.017936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:42.929794+00:00","content_hash":"7b2834e80b6c94249d71c318bd596b25fa1d44a9aff6d8c69ad73958d6cfb8ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}